   "roundness": null,
   "text": "unattended. each piece runs BUILD's machinery on exactly its slice\n(two-tier access) and commits as it verifies. the driver holds\nnothing \u2014 state lives on disk \u2014 so it cuts and resumes fresh\nbetween pieces whenever conditions degrade. cutting costs nothing:\ncut liberally, even per piece.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "unattended. each piece runs BUILD's machinery on exactly its slice\n(two-tier access) and commits as it verifies. the driver holds\nnothing \u2014 state lives on disk \u2014 so it cuts and resumes fresh\nbetween pieces whenever conditions degrade. cutting costs nothing:\ncut liberally, even per piece.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
